WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.900
=Episode 22=

01:33.110 --> 01:33.729
Gentlemen,

01:34.030 --> 01:35.150
fate brought us together

01:35.350 --> 01:36.190
at the academy.

01:36.430 --> 01:37.870
Why don't you talk things through?

01:37.990 --> 01:38.550
Cheng Lisu,

01:39.310 --> 01:39.990
you may not know.

01:41.870 --> 01:43.390
There is no misunderstanding

01:44.430 --> 01:45.350
between us.

01:48.150 --> 01:48.710
Right.

01:49.350 --> 01:50.190
No misunderstandings.

01:50.990 --> 01:51.750
In the end,

01:52.870 --> 01:53.430
I'm nothing

01:53.550 --> 01:55.030
but an oath-breaker.

02:11.990 --> 02:12.550
Look!

02:19.920 --> 02:22.690
(Hua Youxian)

02:40.510 --> 02:41.390
Hua Youxian?

02:42.550 --> 02:43.310
She was

02:43.310 --> 02:44.390
the top of the Ruyun House,

02:44.670 --> 02:45.630
unmatched in Yaojing.

02:46.390 --> 02:47.990
How could she end up in Chonghuai?

03:07.750 --> 03:08.310
Bravo!

03:08.590 --> 03:09.150
Great!

03:11.190 --> 03:11.870
You are

03:11.870 --> 03:12.790
gracefully charming.

03:13.390 --> 03:14.550
You truly deserve

03:14.550 --> 03:15.910
the Ruyun House's reputation.

03:16.790 --> 03:18.190
Your heavenly voice

03:18.390 --> 03:19.470
lives up to its fame.

03:20.110 --> 03:20.870
Our money

03:21.190 --> 03:22.310
was well spent indeed.

04:01.350 --> 04:02.230
Years have passed.

04:02.510 --> 04:03.310
How have you been?

04:03.950 --> 04:04.540
All is well.

04:04.870 --> 04:05.390
Miss Hua,

04:05.550 --> 04:06.110
and you?

04:06.310 --> 04:07.070
I'm well, too.

04:07.830 --> 04:08.590
Speaking of which,

04:08.950 --> 04:10.070
I share a special connection

04:10.110 --> 04:10.950
with you all.

04:11.430 --> 04:12.070
Back then,

04:12.550 --> 04:13.590
I received

04:13.710 --> 04:15.350
a love letter from one of you.

04:16.990 --> 04:19.149
Certain people
always chase after beauties.

04:19.670 --> 04:20.750
It must be his work.

04:21.350 --> 04:22.390
Back then, I ranked

04:22.430 --> 04:24.110
second to last at Xianchang Academy.

04:24.430 --> 04:25.030
I couldn't even

04:25.150 --> 04:26.150
write proper essays,

04:26.510 --> 04:27.790
let alone love letters.

04:28.430 --> 04:30.270
To prove your innocence to Miss Song,

04:30.510 --> 04:31.510
you're exposing this.

04:33.190 --> 04:33.950
Huaijin excels in

04:34.270 --> 04:35.390
arts and martial skills.

04:36.070 --> 04:37.030
He always ranked first

04:37.310 --> 04:38.230
at the academy.

04:38.550 --> 04:39.430
I bet this letter

04:39.590 --> 04:40.430
was his doing.

04:41.870 --> 04:43.190
See? He's not denying it.

04:43.270 --> 04:43.830
It's a yes.

04:44.350 --> 04:45.070
A penalty drink.

04:45.470 --> 04:46.110
Definitely him.

04:46.670 --> 04:48.510
Who knew you would

04:48.510 --> 04:49.950
have such a romantic side?

04:54.590 --> 04:56.070
General Fengyun, since you are here,

04:56.710 --> 04:58.110
as the local magistrate,

04:58.550 --> 04:59.510
I should host you.

05:00.550 --> 05:01.830
Tomorrow, I'll prepare a banquet

05:02.630 --> 05:03.790
and hope you'll come.

05:08.310 --> 05:09.310
It's rare for me to come.

05:10.070 --> 05:11.030
Miss Hua, would you like

05:11.590 --> 05:12.470
to drink with me?

05:20.910 --> 05:21.950
Of course,

05:22.310 --> 05:23.550
I would like to.

05:35.390 --> 05:36.510
Mr. Yang,

05:37.190 --> 05:38.590
why the long face?

06:05.830 --> 06:06.710
Speaking of which,

06:07.030 --> 06:07.910
Miss Hua,

06:08.230 --> 06:09.510
what brought you to Chonghuai?

06:12.710 --> 06:13.910
I met a gentleman.

06:15.230 --> 06:15.870
Believing him

06:16.510 --> 06:17.230
to be

06:17.270 --> 06:18.470
my lifelong partner.

06:19.110 --> 06:20.150
I bought my freedom

06:21.150 --> 06:22.270
and married him.

06:23.070 --> 06:23.830
So

06:24.190 --> 06:25.630
you are married?

06:27.150 --> 06:27.750
Yes.

06:29.510 --> 06:30.270
But

06:31.590 --> 06:32.550
my judgment failed me.

06:33.190 --> 06:33.790
Eventually,

06:34.310 --> 06:35.070
we divorced.

06:38.790 --> 06:40.870
Why the separation?

06:42.350 --> 06:43.670
I entrusted myself

06:43.909 --> 06:44.670
to the wrong man.

06:45.950 --> 06:46.830
You were

06:46.909 --> 06:48.150
once renowned across the land.

06:48.750 --> 06:50.230
I heard of your legendary fame, too.

06:50.950 --> 06:53.150
Choosing marriage at your career's peak

06:53.790 --> 06:54.750
meant you held

06:54.750 --> 06:55.750
deep affection for him.

07:00.310 --> 07:02.550
When I left the Ruyun House, the madam

07:03.030 --> 07:03.710
asked me,

07:04.950 --> 07:06.710
"Have you ever seen a moth fly

07:06.830 --> 07:07.950
into a flame and end well?"

07:08.910 --> 07:10.510
I was young then

07:11.310 --> 07:12.070
and firmly believed

07:12.390 --> 07:13.590
that even a fleeting moment

07:13.950 --> 07:15.590
of warmth would be worth chasing.

07:16.590 --> 07:17.950
I naturally fell for him

07:18.390 --> 07:19.230
and left with him

07:19.350 --> 07:20.110
without hesitation.

07:22.390 --> 07:22.950
Later,

07:24.630 --> 07:26.190
our affection dissipated,

07:27.150 --> 07:28.270
so I left him.

07:28.790 --> 07:29.990
Isn't that human nature?

07:36.950 --> 07:37.550
Now,

07:37.909 --> 07:38.990
I live freely

07:39.030 --> 07:39.750
in this city,

07:40.030 --> 07:41.750
self-sufficient and unbound.

07:41.950 --> 07:42.950
So joyful.

07:44.430 --> 07:45.430
I've never regretted

07:45.590 --> 07:46.870
any decision I've made,

07:47.550 --> 07:49.350
be it past or present.

07:51.390 --> 07:52.750
Your clarity of purpose

07:53.350 --> 07:54.430
is admirable.

07:56.190 --> 07:57.150
Let me toast to you.

08:02.310 --> 08:02.870
Thank you,

08:03.510 --> 08:04.190
Miss.

08:07.790 --> 08:08.750
You have sharp eyes.

08:16.870 --> 08:19.150
Your dance is captivating

08:19.710 --> 08:20.550
and famous.

08:21.310 --> 08:22.310
Now, you're single.

08:23.110 --> 08:23.870
Our garrison has

08:23.910 --> 08:25.030
many outstanding young men.

08:25.670 --> 08:26.230
Perhaps

08:26.710 --> 08:28.150
some might suit your standards?

08:31.070 --> 08:32.710
Your brave warriors

08:32.990 --> 08:35.030
are certainly worthy of me.

08:38.429 --> 08:39.030
Xiao Jue.

08:40.070 --> 08:40.830
What do you mean?

08:41.030 --> 08:42.510
(He's egging him on.)

08:42.710 --> 08:44.270
Both are unwed.

08:44.790 --> 08:45.670
Why not play

08:46.390 --> 08:47.270
the matchmaker?

08:52.910 --> 08:53.670
It's my marriage.

08:54.230 --> 08:55.150
None of your concern.

08:56.110 --> 08:56.710
I...

08:57.590 --> 08:58.230
I...

09:02.990 --> 09:04.630
Miss Hua is beautiful and skilled in

09:04.750 --> 09:05.470
song and dance.

09:05.950 --> 09:06.590
She deserves

09:06.630 --> 09:08.110
a promising young partner.

09:08.550 --> 09:09.590
Why do you object?

09:10.110 --> 09:10.830
Exactly. Huaijin.

09:11.390 --> 09:12.070
Go introduce her

09:12.070 --> 09:12.790
to some brave ones

09:12.910 --> 09:13.750
of your men.

09:15.550 --> 09:16.350
Naturally.

09:18.070 --> 09:18.950
Xiao Jue.

09:25.470 --> 09:26.030
Youxian.

09:27.550 --> 09:28.350
The love letter

09:28.910 --> 09:29.950
was from you, right?

09:32.270 --> 09:32.990
Her ex-husband

09:33.710 --> 09:34.390
is also you.

09:34.830 --> 09:36.230
So it was you all along.

09:39.590 --> 09:40.190
Back then,

09:40.910 --> 09:41.950
we were both young.

09:52.310 --> 09:54.110
I want to buy your freedom.

09:55.470 --> 09:56.030
I wonder

09:56.750 --> 09:57.670
if you would like

09:58.790 --> 10:00.110
to become my wife?

10:06.630 --> 10:08.790
Our backgrounds are worlds apart.

10:13.350 --> 10:15.150
Marriage isn't a game.

10:15.910 --> 10:17.670
There's too much at stake.

10:19.190 --> 10:20.110
Let me think again.

10:20.870 --> 10:21.710
Stop right there!

10:23.710 --> 10:26.230
Dreaming of marrying a courtesan?

10:26.910 --> 10:28.070
You'll disgrace our family!

10:28.990 --> 10:31.110
Defending a traitor against your father?

10:31.430 --> 10:32.390
Leave now,

10:32.630 --> 10:34.310
and you're no longer a Yang!

10:34.830 --> 10:36.230
Don't come back ever!

10:51.550 --> 10:52.990
Why torture yourself?

10:59.150 --> 11:00.310
Come away with me.

11:04.550 --> 11:05.110
Alright.

11:05.910 --> 11:06.910
I'll go with you.

11:07.060 --> 11:13.760
(Yang Mansion)

11:17.350 --> 11:18.230
I'm worthless.

11:22.030 --> 11:22.710
Tell me.

11:23.590 --> 11:24.990
What's truly burdening you?

11:28.070 --> 11:28.750
Tell me!

11:37.830 --> 11:38.550
Give back my wine.

11:47.950 --> 11:48.590
Enough.

11:50.790 --> 11:51.630
Let's divorce.

11:54.990 --> 11:55.830
May we

11:56.470 --> 11:57.630
never meet again.

12:07.510 --> 12:08.430
I'm unworthy.

12:09.470 --> 12:10.110
Mingzhi,

12:10.670 --> 12:12.110
how could you be so blind?

12:13.470 --> 12:14.710
You never compromised your will

12:15.590 --> 12:16.390
or dignity.

12:17.070 --> 12:18.910
So free-spirited and open-hearted.

12:19.350 --> 12:20.590
Truly admirable.

12:20.950 --> 12:23.150
You should be our role model as women.

12:24.750 --> 12:25.430
I'm flattered.

12:25.990 --> 12:26.990
Life is too short

12:27.350 --> 12:28.670
to waste on self-compromise.

12:35.070 --> 12:35.630
Youxian.

12:37.950 --> 12:38.590
You...

12:40.110 --> 12:41.030
failed the Commander

12:41.510 --> 12:42.830
and then Miss Hua.

12:43.990 --> 12:45.270
A blind and foolish man.

12:47.550 --> 12:48.230
I was thinking

12:51.190 --> 12:52.270
back then, the Commander

12:53.030 --> 12:54.510
lost both parents,

12:55.030 --> 12:56.310
his comrades fell in battle,

12:57.110 --> 12:58.230
and his friend betrayed him.

12:58.750 --> 13:00.070
Knowing something was wrong

13:00.510 --> 13:01.630
but finding no proof.

13:02.710 --> 13:04.270
That feeling of helplessness

13:05.550 --> 13:06.590
must have been unbearable.

13:11.070 --> 13:12.110
As for Miss Hua,

13:12.590 --> 13:13.910
who became your wife,

13:14.630 --> 13:16.870
she deserved your respect,

13:20.030 --> 13:21.430
but you neglected her.

13:22.470 --> 13:23.310
Did you think

13:23.830 --> 13:24.550
avoiding violence

13:25.030 --> 13:25.710
meant keeping

13:25.790 --> 13:26.870
your gentleman's code?

13:27.950 --> 13:28.670
Don't you know

13:29.350 --> 13:31.230
complete indifference and neglect

13:31.630 --> 13:32.790
hurt more than blows?

13:33.870 --> 13:34.750
It means

13:35.430 --> 13:36.350
from your heart

13:37.310 --> 13:38.350
to your eyes,

13:39.670 --> 13:41.230
she ceased to exist.

13:53.390 --> 13:54.710
My father's wrongful conviction

13:55.430 --> 13:56.510
has nothing to do with you.

13:57.630 --> 13:59.030
I never expected

13:59.710 --> 14:00.430
your single word

14:00.790 --> 14:02.150
to change everything.

14:03.190 --> 14:04.230
I did resent you

14:04.230 --> 14:06.790
for your disrespectful remarks,

14:08.150 --> 14:09.150
but that's in the past.

14:10.230 --> 14:11.190
We're but specks

14:11.190 --> 14:12.750
in the vast river of time,

14:13.350 --> 14:14.310
gone in an instant.

14:16.030 --> 14:17.030
I won't lecture you,

14:18.630 --> 14:20.150
nor should you trap yourself.

14:23.710 --> 14:24.910
When you're at rock bottom,

14:25.870 --> 14:27.230
every step taken

14:28.910 --> 14:29.910
is upward progress.

14:31.030 --> 14:32.710
Escapism and despair achieve nothing.

14:33.790 --> 14:35.030
I'll find the truth to clear

14:35.950 --> 14:36.790
my father's name

14:37.950 --> 14:38.950
and restore honor

14:40.670 --> 14:41.990
to the Xiao Army.

14:43.830 --> 14:44.870
That day will come.

14:49.710 --> 14:50.790
As for Miss Hua,

14:52.030 --> 14:53.150
rather than feeling guilty,

14:53.950 --> 14:54.830
take action instead.

14:56.070 --> 14:56.990
Self-pity

14:58.150 --> 14:58.990
is utterly useless.

15:06.190 --> 15:07.070
Stop drinking.

15:07.230 --> 15:07.870
You'll be drunk.

15:09.670 --> 15:11.470
Do you have troubles, Miss?

15:18.390 --> 15:20.750
I made a righteous lecture earlier,

15:22.590 --> 15:24.910
but I'm just a deserter myself.

15:25.910 --> 15:27.110
What right do I have

15:27.390 --> 15:28.950
to criticize Yang Mingzhi?

15:30.990 --> 15:32.750
How ridiculous.

15:35.750 --> 15:36.670
You must have

15:38.070 --> 15:39.230
your own struggles, too.

15:47.470 --> 15:48.870
My minor troubles

15:50.150 --> 15:51.790
pale compared to his suffering.

15:53.350 --> 15:54.470
They're insignificant.

15:56.990 --> 15:59.350
But I see your pain.

16:19.870 --> 16:20.510
Youxian.

16:32.390 --> 16:33.030
I was wrong.

16:34.590 --> 16:35.990
I won't ask your forgiveness.

16:36.830 --> 16:37.590
I just wish

16:38.910 --> 16:40.350
to return to your side.

16:41.630 --> 16:43.830
If possible,

16:44.510 --> 16:45.310
I want to make up

16:45.310 --> 16:46.270
for the hurt I caused.

16:48.190 --> 16:48.870
It is

16:50.910 --> 16:51.670
none of my concern.

16:53.830 --> 16:54.390
Youxian.

17:01.270 --> 17:01.870
Youxian.

17:02.430 --> 17:03.310
That's my only wish.

17:04.230 --> 17:05.150
You can ignore me,

17:05.829 --> 17:06.470
reject me,

17:07.550 --> 17:08.869
but I want to stay with you

17:12.550 --> 17:13.829
because I truly love you.

17:44.910 --> 17:45.710
Actually...

17:48.430 --> 17:50.030
Actually, I...

17:54.390 --> 17:56.110
How much did you drink tonight?

17:58.830 --> 18:00.150
Will you hate me?

18:09.230 --> 18:09.790
Commander.

18:12.750 --> 18:13.270
Commander.

18:16.750 --> 18:17.670
He Yan let me

18:17.710 --> 18:19.030
deliver this letter to you.

18:23.550 --> 18:25.910
(By the riverside pavilion,
awaiting our conversation.)

18:26.350 --> 18:27.110
(I'll be waiting.)

18:27.430 --> 18:28.910
You see each other every day.

18:29.030 --> 18:30.390
Why write letters instead of

18:30.790 --> 18:31.510
speaking directly?

18:38.910 --> 18:39.630
Mr. Xiao.

18:42.910 --> 18:43.550
Miss Hua.

18:45.750 --> 18:46.470
I came here

18:46.470 --> 18:47.750
to thank you.

18:48.150 --> 18:48.790
Why?

18:49.190 --> 18:50.190
You went to great trouble

18:50.190 --> 18:51.070
to help

18:51.190 --> 18:52.070
Yang Mingzhi and me.

18:52.910 --> 18:54.510
I'm deeply grateful.

18:57.110 --> 18:58.230
I wanted to beat him up,

18:58.830 --> 19:00.790
but the opportunity slipped away.

19:03.150 --> 19:05.030
So you're blaming me, Mr. Xiao?

19:06.750 --> 19:07.790
His choice to be with me

19:07.870 --> 19:08.550
is his freedom.

19:09.150 --> 19:10.230
And how I choose to respond

19:10.550 --> 19:11.350
is mine.

19:11.870 --> 19:12.470
Good then.

19:13.270 --> 19:13.910
I'm sorry.

19:14.510 --> 19:15.190
I have to go.

19:16.990 --> 19:17.500
By the way,

19:18.590 --> 19:20.110
someone came with you to Ruyun House

19:20.390 --> 19:21.510
back then too.

19:22.270 --> 19:23.390
I remember very clearly.

19:24.030 --> 19:25.110
Delicate yet determined,

19:25.390 --> 19:26.230
wearing a mask,

19:26.670 --> 19:27.950
refusing to reveal the identity.

19:28.910 --> 19:29.990
Where is the person now?

19:31.830 --> 19:32.790
All things pass away.

19:34.030 --> 19:34.990
Not worth mentioning.

19:38.590 --> 19:39.390
So,

19:39.630 --> 19:41.670
you two have grown distant?

19:43.310 --> 19:43.870
Right.

19:44.150 --> 19:45.950
You've been battling everywhere.

19:46.430 --> 19:47.230
It must've been hard

19:47.270 --> 19:48.270
for you to stay in touch.

19:49.230 --> 19:50.830
After all, she's a lady.

19:55.350 --> 19:56.070
What?

19:59.870 --> 20:01.310
Don't you know, Mr. Xiao?

20:01.630 --> 20:03.390
She wore a chest binder

20:04.150 --> 20:05.190
and acted so nervous.

20:05.590 --> 20:06.830
When I casually teased her,

20:06.990 --> 20:08.110
she became flustered.

20:08.470 --> 20:10.710
That shy, nervous demeanor
could only belong

20:11.110 --> 20:11.950
to a young lady.

20:12.310 --> 20:13.590
My eyes never deceive me.

20:15.890 --> 20:20.190
(Yunlai Inn)

20:20.190 --> 20:21.190
Strangely enough,

20:21.830 --> 20:22.870
He Rufei's sister

20:23.590 --> 20:24.950
is also called

20:24.990 --> 20:25.790
He Yan.

20:29.270 --> 20:30.350
A woman like you

20:31.230 --> 20:33.390
joined Yezhou Garrison as a new recruit.

20:34.190 --> 20:35.590
There must be a hidden story.

20:36.470 --> 20:37.350
The day will come

20:38.630 --> 20:40.030
when your secrets are uncovered.

20:40.910 --> 20:42.270
What secrets could I have?

20:43.110 --> 20:44.030
We were simply

20:44.950 --> 20:46.150
meant to meet each other.

20:49.110 --> 20:50.550
Beware of He Rufei.

20:51.750 --> 20:52.910
He made me hold back

20:52.950 --> 20:54.510
General Xiao's plea for help

20:55.390 --> 20:56.790
for a few days.

20:57.430 --> 20:58.390
Beware of whom?

21:01.630 --> 21:02.590
(Who are you really?)

21:03.550 --> 21:05.190
(Miss He Yan from the He family?)

21:05.670 --> 21:06.590
(Or He Rufei, the one)

21:06.590 --> 21:08.230
(from back then who was afraid)

21:09.430 --> 21:10.430
(to show his true face?)

21:12.190 --> 21:13.390
(If you're He Rufei,)

21:14.150 --> 21:15.670
(then who is the current He Rufei?)

21:16.310 --> 21:17.950
(If you're the He Rufei of old,)

21:18.070 --> 21:18.790
(why would you)

21:19.270 --> 21:20.710
(abandon us in our direst hour?)

22:33.270 --> 22:33.820
Commander.

22:41.110 --> 22:42.710
You do know the Xiao's sword techniques.

22:43.310 --> 22:44.030
You've found out.

22:44.510 --> 22:45.710
The Qinglang Sword Style

22:46.310 --> 22:47.310
is known by the Xiaos

22:48.230 --> 22:49.590
and one other person only.

22:52.990 --> 22:53.550
Exactly.

22:55.950 --> 22:57.270
I was once He Rufei.

22:58.630 --> 22:59.710
That's not my true name.

23:00.750 --> 23:01.710
I am He Yan,

23:02.750 --> 23:03.510
the stepsister

23:03.550 --> 23:04.590
of the current He Rufei.

23:05.750 --> 23:06.710
From childhood,

23:07.590 --> 23:08.990
our identities were swapped.

23:09.870 --> 23:10.870
You exchanged identities?

23:11.630 --> 23:12.510
I've been He Rufei

23:12.950 --> 23:14.190
for as long as I can remember.

23:14.790 --> 23:15.390
They claimed

23:15.830 --> 23:17.190
my brother wouldn't live long.

23:17.830 --> 23:19.230
I had to impersonate He Rufei,

23:20.110 --> 23:21.230
or the family's noble title

23:21.710 --> 23:22.670
would be revoked.

23:24.390 --> 23:25.190
So I had no choice

23:25.270 --> 23:26.630
but to live as He Rufei.

23:28.070 --> 23:29.150
But I refused to submit to

23:29.190 --> 23:29.910
such a fate.

23:30.510 --> 23:31.510
So I left home and joined

23:32.030 --> 23:32.990
the Fuyue Army.

23:33.870 --> 23:34.710
I earned merits

23:35.390 --> 23:36.230
and received honors,

23:37.350 --> 23:38.990
but my brother who should've died young

23:40.390 --> 23:41.550
was still alive.

23:42.750 --> 23:43.790
When he returned home,

23:45.470 --> 23:46.710
he poisoned and blinded me.

23:48.150 --> 23:50.190
Then he stole General Feihong's identity

23:51.390 --> 23:53.110
and even tried to kill me.

23:58.230 --> 23:59.430
Perhaps God

24:00.430 --> 24:01.550
took pity on me,

24:02.510 --> 24:03.830
giving me another chance at life.

24:05.150 --> 24:06.710
That's how He Yan came to be.

24:07.710 --> 24:08.710
I am He Yan,

24:09.350 --> 24:10.270
but also He Rufei.

24:11.630 --> 24:13.270
I told you I wanted to earn glory.

24:13.950 --> 24:14.710
That wasn't a lie.

24:15.510 --> 24:16.430
Because I have to

24:17.110 --> 24:18.030
rise to his level

24:18.070 --> 24:19.070
to expose his lies

24:20.630 --> 24:22.110
and prevent him

24:23.710 --> 24:24.590
from harming

24:24.670 --> 24:25.710
more innocent people.

24:27.710 --> 24:28.830
Anything that belongs to me,

24:30.230 --> 24:31.670
I will reclaim personally.

24:36.390 --> 24:37.390
Xiao Jue, sorry

24:38.710 --> 24:39.710
for keeping it from you.

24:41.030 --> 24:41.990
I just didn't know

24:42.910 --> 24:43.990
how to face you.

24:44.190 --> 24:44.870
Only a question.

24:45.630 --> 24:46.630
In the Mingshui Battle,

24:47.550 --> 24:49.070
was it you who delayed

24:50.790 --> 24:51.750
the reinforcements?

24:57.670 --> 24:58.310
Yes.

24:59.350 --> 25:00.230
I sent

25:01.030 --> 25:02.510
late reinforcements...

25:03.230 --> 25:04.710
30,000 Xiao Army soldiers died,

25:06.150 --> 25:07.790
and my parents died one after another.

25:08.510 --> 25:10.150
There's a conspiracy in the battle. I...

25:10.190 --> 25:11.430
After lying to me for so long,

25:12.310 --> 25:13.190
how can you expect me

25:13.230 --> 25:14.990
to believe your one-sided claims?

25:21.430 --> 25:22.030
You're right.

25:23.630 --> 25:24.630
I deceived you.

25:25.510 --> 25:26.630
How could I demand

25:27.350 --> 25:28.870
your immediate trust?

25:33.990 --> 25:35.630
But I will find evidence

25:36.550 --> 25:37.630
to uncover the truth.

25:43.030 --> 25:44.590
If you don't want to see me again,

25:47.030 --> 25:48.150
I'll leave.

25:52.990 --> 25:57.150
♪Perhaps I'll regret saying goodbye♪

26:00.000 --> 26:05.310
♪Maybe we can't share sorrows and joys♪

26:05.310 --> 26:05.820
Commander,

26:06.390 --> 26:07.170
if you don't do it,

26:07.350 --> 26:07.990
let me kill her!

26:09.790 --> 26:10.370
Commander,

26:10.790 --> 26:11.750
she killed so many.

26:12.310 --> 26:13.230
How can we let her go?

26:13.830 --> 26:14.870
Letting her walk free

26:15.870 --> 26:16.790
is too merciful.

26:20.610 --> 26:25.670
♪Before fate is confirmed♪

26:25.670 --> 26:27.150
You will stay in Yezhou Garrison.

26:28.150 --> 26:29.150
You can't leave there

26:30.230 --> 26:31.510
until the truth is uncovered.

26:34.140 --> 26:37.890
♪Lifelong devotion turns into a vow♪

26:38.050 --> 26:41.270
♪That's my last wish♪

26:42.180 --> 26:48.020
♪Awaiting the spread of moonlight♪

27:00.030 --> 27:00.910
How about...?

27:24.750 --> 27:25.350
- Commander.
- Commander.

27:26.870 --> 27:27.390
We're here.

28:06.630 --> 28:07.150
(Today,)

28:07.710 --> 28:08.310
you can

28:08.310 --> 28:09.510
do everything you wish to do

28:10.190 --> 28:11.150
without worries.

28:12.310 --> 28:13.390
Just be your true self

28:13.870 --> 28:14.870
as you've always been.

28:15.670 --> 28:16.470
Whatever you like

28:17.230 --> 28:17.990
and dislike,

28:18.870 --> 28:19.590
(say it outright.)

28:20.510 --> 28:21.310
(Cheer yourself up.)

28:22.070 --> 28:22.830
(Can I truly)

28:23.350 --> 28:24.870
do whatever I want?

28:26.150 --> 28:26.910
Do as you please.

28:30.390 --> 28:30.950
Okay.

28:31.510 --> 28:32.390
Do as I please.

28:34.400 --> 28:42.050
♪What is there to fear?
We'll move forward together♪

28:43.100 --> 28:49.280
♪Through endless dawns and dusks,
to eternity♪

28:49.730 --> 28:53.490
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

28:53.890 --> 28:56.410
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

28:56.830 --> 29:00.870
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

29:00.870 --> 29:01.710
(Only a hundred.)

29:02.390 --> 29:03.590
(As long as it pleases you,)

29:04.550 --> 29:05.310
(it's worth it.)

29:08.380 --> 29:12.290
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

29:12.610 --> 29:15.270
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

29:15.270 --> 29:16.150
Does it look good?

29:17.230 --> 29:17.910
Yeah.

29:19.280 --> 29:23.040
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

29:23.510 --> 29:25.970
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

29:26.720 --> 29:33.430
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

29:33.430 --> 29:37.820
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

29:37.920 --> 29:41.840
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

29:42.170 --> 29:48.700
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

30:05.190 --> 30:07.470
My bottom.

30:10.070 --> 30:11.470
You really did it!

30:12.030 --> 30:12.640
Wang Ba.

30:12.910 --> 30:13.950
Can you smell meat?

30:16.630 --> 30:17.390
Oh, really.

30:17.630 --> 30:18.790
No, stop. Stop fighting.

30:19.070 --> 30:20.750
I didn't eat lunch.

30:21.590 --> 30:22.510
Let's stop.

30:27.430 --> 30:28.150
Wait...

30:28.910 --> 30:29.430
Where's it?

30:30.470 --> 30:31.100
Meat.

30:31.430 --> 30:32.030
Take a rest.

30:39.310 --> 30:39.830
He,

30:40.070 --> 30:41.470
you're getting stronger these days.

30:41.950 --> 30:42.670
He was skilled.

30:43.150 --> 30:44.190
Now, he trains every day.

30:44.830 --> 30:46.110
He naturally keeps improving.

30:48.110 --> 30:49.350
But sustaining this long-term,

30:49.670 --> 30:50.830
how can his body endure it?

30:54.430 --> 30:55.910
Commander, Mr. Shen.

30:56.550 --> 30:57.180
Commander.

30:58.550 --> 30:59.070
Commander.

30:59.070 --> 30:59.590
Make way.

31:03.070 --> 31:03.650
Make way.

31:05.150 --> 31:05.950
Focus on training.

31:29.090 --> 31:31.250
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

31:31.360 --> 31:35.280
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

31:35.450 --> 31:37.400
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

31:37.490 --> 31:42.420
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

31:54.510 --> 31:55.920
♪I've seen the mountains♪

31:56.120 --> 31:57.540
♪And trodden through ice♪

31:57.800 --> 32:00.620
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

32:00.930 --> 32:02.320
♪Destiny is my creed♪

32:02.380 --> 32:03.780
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

32:03.920 --> 32:05.720
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

32:06.920 --> 32:08.390
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

32:08.560 --> 32:09.850
♪Gazing through the mire♪

32:10.020 --> 32:12.420
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

32:12.610 --> 32:14.660
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

32:15.800 --> 32:17.630
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

32:19.590 --> 32:22.510
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

32:22.600 --> 32:25.260
♪There must always be a longing♪

32:25.710 --> 32:30.780
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

32:31.110 --> 32:33.120
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

32:33.430 --> 32:37.080
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

32:37.310 --> 32:39.210
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

32:39.240 --> 32:43.080
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

32:43.440 --> 32:45.380
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

32:45.560 --> 32:49.380
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

32:49.640 --> 32:55.390
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

32:56.280 --> 33:01.750
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

